  "narrations": {
    "one-incident-135-papers--narration-0": {
      "id": "one-incident-135-papers--narration-0",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here is an incident. A code change leaks memory, a surge of traffic sets it off, and a service runs out of memory. Root cause analysis should recover that whole chain."
        }
      ]
    },
    "one-incident-135-papers--narration-1": {
      "id": "one-incident-135-papers--narration-1",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We read 135 papers that try, and none returns it whole."
        }
      ]
    },
    "same-data-different-goals--narration-0": {
      "id": "same-data-different-goals--narration-0",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sorted by the data they consume, metrics, logs or traces, they look like one task."
        }
      ]
    },
    "same-data-different-goals--narration-1": {
      "id": "same-data-different-goals--narration-1",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "But an engineer restoring service needs the trigger, the surge, while a developer fixing it for good needs the root cause, the leaking commit."
        }
      ]
    },
    "sorted-by-goal--narration-0": {
      "id": "sorted-by-goal--narration-0",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "So we sorted the papers by goal: seven of them, from correlating data to acting on a diagnosis."
        }
      ]
    },
    "sorted-by-goal--narration-1": {
      "id": "sorted-by-goal--narration-1",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each pushes one edge of a trade-off between effectiveness, data and cost."
        }
      ]
    },
    "points-not-the-path--narration-0": {
      "id": "points-not-the-path--narration-0",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "On the incident, the papers gather on single points, mostly the root cause, and over half of the causes they study are resource faults."
        }
      ]
    },
    "points-not-the-path--narration-1": {
      "id": "points-not-the-path--narration-1",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The path between the points is still missing. Building it is the next step."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
